{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的出身情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱庚申、月柱甲申、日柱己巳、时柱壬申。日主己土生于申月，金旺土虚，月干甲木正官克身，年柱庚申伤官生财，时柱壬申正财坐伤官。整体格局为伤官生财，但日主偏弱，财星（壬水）透干，伤官（庚金）强旺，财多身弱之象。\n\n出身看年月柱。年柱庚申为伤官坐劫财，伤官代表祖上清贫或技艺谋生，劫财主破耗，且年柱干支皆金，金旺泄土，祖上根基不厚。月柱甲申，正官坐伤官，官星被伤官克制，主父辈事业有波折，非大富之象。时柱壬申为正财坐伤官，财星虽透但坐伤官，财源不稳。\n\n综合判断，命主出身非贫非富，属于普通家庭，父母虽能维持生计，但积蓄不多，符合“出身普通，虽不捉襟见肘，可惜盈余不多”的描述。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3506, "response_id": "77770375-53cf-4aa1-bbfc-ef879fef038f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 251, "completion_tokens": 259, "total_tokens": 510, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 123}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
